      <title>15万辆特斯拉驶入澳洲：电动巨头如何改写市场，投资者该如何捕捉未来机遇？</title>
      <link>https://johhhhnny.github.io/TeslaDaily/posts/20251113-15%E4%B8%87%E8%BE%86%E7%89%B9%E6%96%AF%E6%8B%89%E9%A9%B6%E5%85%A5%E6%BE%B3%E6%B4%B2%E7%94%B5%E5%8A%A8%E5%B7%A8%E5%A4%B4%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%94%B9%E5%86%99%E5%B8%82%E5%9C%BA%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E8%80%85%E8%AF%A5%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%8D%95%E6%8D%89%E6%9C%AA%E6%9D%A5%E6%9C%BA%E9%81%87/</link>
